WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.400
Scoring methodology.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:08.275
CIJA Lobbied adds 4 points for MPs directly lobbied per CIJA raw CSV.

00:00:08.275 --> 00:00:12.987
Top Lobbied adds 3 for those in the Commissioner of Lobbying top list.

00:00:12.987 --> 00:00:17.250
On Board adds 5 for MPs on the investigation board.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:22.400
Emergencies Era adds 2 for service during the Emergencies Act period.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.600
A score of zero means the MP was not found in any negative database.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.712
Being flagged does not imply wrongdoing.

00:00:30.712 --> 00:00:32.800
Lobbying is legal.
